WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:35.860
I am Kurata Sana, first year of
middle school.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.240
My manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.240
My best friend I met in the
bathroom, Fuka.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.830
The mysterious white bat, Babbit!

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.790
Away run to is to run away.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.540
The one who has always been with
me in New York, Naozumi-kun!

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:50.790
Right now we are still very close.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.050
Hayama Akito, we are very good friends, or at least I think we are.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:56.260
He is going out with Fuka right now.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:59.550
Sana-chan, Naozumi-kun!
Welcome back!

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.550
Thank you, it's been a long time!

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.430
You two are still very close I see.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.680
There were rumors from New York
that you two are going out.

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:07.730
Is this true?

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:08.810
Yes!

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.770
This is... Hayama-kun?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.980
He's a problem child.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.610
He acts like he's good now,

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.280
but I heard that in elementary school he was a notorious bad student.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.450
Bad?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.620
If you have time for these kinds
of rubbish magazines...

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.670
why don't you do something productive?

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.830
Like studying, or sports.

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.420
Fuka!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.340
Akito is not that kind of person,

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.800
Sengoku-sensei is the one to blame.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.310
What will you say when you see
that picture?

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.150
Hayama, this is great.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.360
You two are perfect...

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.910
Hayama and Fuka.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:10.250
The Manager Danger

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.170
- See you, bye bye!
- Good night.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.790
Be careful, okay?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.090
Sana-chan looks energetic.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.090
Her relationship with Naozumi-kun
is also going well.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.390
Naozumi-kun seems like a gentle
and nice person.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.350
Sana-chan and him
are a good match.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.430
I think so too.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.560
You two really
look great together.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.110
With Fuka, Hayama will have
no problem.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.360
It's good how things turned out.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.240
Fuka-chan and Hayama-kun,
Sana-chan and Naozumi-kun.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.780
It feels like everybody has won
the best couple award.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.500
But, still Tsuyoshi-kun and I are
the best couple.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.450
Here it comes again.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.620
- Aya-chan, really!
- But it's true!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.800
Akito-kun, did I say something
wrong? Did I...

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.550
Not really...

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:05.300
Akito, the whole time you weren't happy
that we won the best couple prize.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.100
Right?

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.850
What? Everybody thinks you two
look great together.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.230
- Right?
- Yeah.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.480
Going this way to Fuka's house is
quicker, right?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.900
I'll see you home.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.110
Okay. You're right.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.530
See you later.

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.190
Bye!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.860
Hayama, do you remember Fuka's house?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:25.110
Hayama has no
sense of direction

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.780
Akito! Akito!

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.330
Could you slow down?
I can't keep up with you.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.540
- Are you okay?
- I'm okay.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.630
Let me see.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.260
It's coming out.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.260
Snot.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.090
Akito, that jerk...
and I thought...

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.430
Stop... wait! Akito!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.480
I'm not really happy now!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:54.980
Not happy...

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.610
You're not really happy means...

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.400
If you think of bad things,
then you'll be unhappy.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.440
If you think of bad things,

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.320
you'll be UN-HAP-PY.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.910
Why do you say it like that?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.660
It's about time you have this
sort of emotion then.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:10.990
Oh, the amusement park tickets we
won for the best couple award!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.580
How come these are so wrinkled?

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.040
These are memorable things.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.960
It does say on the ticket that
it's a memorable place... don't joke around.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.210
Yes... Yes, it says so...

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.710
You want to go this Saturday?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.550
Right, then let's invite
Tsuyoshi-kun, Aya-chan...

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.640
Only you going will be fine.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.350
You're saying...

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.600
There are only two tickets.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.770
That's true...

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.400
If you don't want to go then fine.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.610
I didn't say I don't want to go.
Wait... Hey, Akito!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.190
I really want to go.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.030
Then we'll go together.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.370
Well.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.700
Wait for me.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:53.910
Who are you?

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.580
The very happy Fuka

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:55.200
The white dolphin.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.340
So while I was going home...

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.590
Good morning!

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.630
Nice weather today, right?

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.470
Good weather?

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:15.310
It looks like it is going to rain today.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:20.190
You're so picky!
Why can't you eat it all?

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.520
Do you want some?

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:25.190
Idiot! I would not want to eat
something that you already ate.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.320
There is rice on your face.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.530
About the amusement park tomorrow,

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.830
we'll meet at the bus station
at 11:30, right?

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.120
- At the nearest bus station, right?
- Right.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.710
I'll bring a homemade lunchbox
tomorrow.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.870
Ah? Bring a homemade lunchbox?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.630
Just the two of you going to
the amusement park?

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.290
That's great...

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.380
We were planning
to invite you two...

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.840
Don't worry about us.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.840
This is your first
one-on-one date, right?

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:53.390
Just thinking about Akito-kun and
Fuka-chan going on a date

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.930
makes me very happy.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:58.020
- Going on a date is great, right?
- Yeah.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.560
Announcement!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.690
This is the first time for them
on a date on their own.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.650
Stop talking like that!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.570
Why is he smirking?

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.370
Hello.
Is this Matsui Fuka's house?

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.200
This is Sengoku-sensei from
Jinbo school.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.910
Is something wrong with Fuka?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.370
Huh? Amusement park?

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.040
Sana-chan!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.090
Take a look at this!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.800
Ah... This is Hayama-kun and
Fuka-chan, the best couple awards...

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.050
Yeah, they look so great together!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.010
It's just like best couples in
films!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.220
Fuka, are you cold?

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.060
Just being with Akito will be fine.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.440
You shouldn't have said that,
I was going to hold you.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.520
Oh, it's embarrassing! Gosh, Akito!

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.570
Those who watch them should be
embarrassed.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.190
This is really the best couple!

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.240
It's too scary, Teen Net!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.780
Sana-chan, it's not polite to do that.
Hurry up and come down.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.450
They really are a good couple.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.540
Sana-chan!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.670
Right! I have to work hard today!
Work! Work!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:05.790
Naozumi-kun!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:06.880
Sana-chan!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.460
I was just
about to go look for you,

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.470
because suddenly
I got really hungry.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.180
I just got a lot of junk food.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.140
Really? Then let's go and eat.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:17.720
That's great.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.270
Very hot!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.310
Is he stupid?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.730
Just pose as you like.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:24.980
Yes!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.990
Huh? It's not good?

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.780
No, Sana-chan is okay.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.450
But Naozumi-kun seems to be
a little stiff.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.160
I will do anything!
I will try my best!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.660
- Naozumi-kun! We'll work hard together!
- Sana-chan!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.710
Like this, like this.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.090
Are you in the mood? Let's try it!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.670
Shaking, isn't a problem!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.510
Because this is shake shake dance!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:56.140
Naozumi-kun and I are good
friends, the thing we like most is to dance.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.930
We are dancing from the heart.
Shake shake dance!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.600
Look, look! Catch me!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.980
No matter the weather,
our friendship stays the same!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:07.150
Just like this... jump!
Us two will jump!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:12.780
Let's take a break.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.400
Take a break.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.780
Break

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.030
Naozumi.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.200
Are you free for a minute?

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:26.080
Ah, Madea-san!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.080
You came back to Japan alright!
That's great.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.590
Yeah... I was so lonely and upset...

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:33.630
Fatty, you haven't
changed!

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:33.260
It seems like you have gained more
weight, it's really hot like this.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.800
What? Maeda-san, you won't
be my manager anymore?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:41.140
Nao, I want to be your manager forever.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.970
But this is decided by the agency.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.140
How can it be so sudden?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:51.650
Yes, we have been through a lot
together.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.150
Maeda-san.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.900
Naozumi...
I don't want to leave you!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.150
Me neither!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.780
Mae-rin!

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.820
I'm coming.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.830
Mae-rin!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.750
Chris-chan!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.960
Gosh, Mae-rin,
you're my manager, right?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.170
If I get lost again because
you are not around

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.380
it would be terrible.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.970
I'm sorry, Chris-chan, I'll be
more careful from now on!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.010
This is...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:21.260
This is how it looks... She is
the one I have to take care of from now on.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.720
Kusanagi Chris-chan.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.310
I am Chris, nice to meet you.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.680
Super cute!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.100
You jerk! You jerk!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.770
It didn't hurt!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.190
A speechless Maeda

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.310
This is not funny.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.480
It's getting late.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.570
Who is my new manager?

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.610
Yes. We are to meet here.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.530
We are going to leave first then.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:40.990
Okay.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.950
Nao, good luck!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.740
- See you later!
- See you!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.700
Hurry! Hurry! We're gonna be late.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:03.140
Oh! Naozumi-kun!
Let me take a picture!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.260
I...

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.520
Another weird person...

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.890
Who is this?

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.940
I... I... Naozumi-kun
is even cuter up close!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.320
I am your new manager...
Ozaki Riho!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.740
You can call me Riho,
even Riho-P will be fine!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.200
Ah! You're still cute when
you're scared!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.370
You are definitely my favorite
child star!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.620
Hope we work well together
from now on.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.040
Ah! Sana-chan! Sana-chan!
Sana-chan!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.960
You are absolutely cute!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.460
Who is she?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.340
She's my new manager...

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.010
She looks more like a crazy fan.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.840
- Can I take one more picture?
- Sure, sure.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.220
Peace!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.310
- Sana-chan, thank you.
- You're welcome.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.520
I'm so happy I'm going to dance.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.650
- You can dance?
- Me too.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:56.150
- What is she called?
- I am Kurata Sana!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:12:00.240
- Then what are you called?
- I am Ozaki Riho.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.950
- So what is this person called?
- Eh... I am Sagami Rei!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.120
Finally, what is your name?

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.200
Um...

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.120
Let the cute
person answer for him!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.000
His name is Kamura Naozumi-kun.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.920
Let's all work well together!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:16.210
Wah! Sana-chan!
You are a great person!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.050
Riho-chan, you're great too!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.550
- Sana-chan, let's work well together!
- Same here!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.090
- We will be good friends, right?
- Of course!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.060
Are you going somewhere?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.440
I've promised to
go out with some friends.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:34.770
Friends?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.310
Yeah, like Aya-chan
and Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.780
Sengoku-sensei called.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.660
Aren't you going with Hayama Akito
to the amusement park?

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.030
Listen to me...

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.330
If you are going to lie then break up with him now!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.540
Why are you being all subjective?

